Final CPython 3.15 ABI backport
=============================

The complete upstream test work is on the rolling branch
https://github.com/StableKite/pyo3/tree/codex/python315-abi-028
based on official v0.28.2. Source fixes are backports of upstream PRs 5873,
5918 and the type-layout portion of 6014; no duplicate upstream PR is needed.

With PYO3_PYTHON pointing at an actual final free-threaded CPython and
RUSTFLAGS='-D warnings', run from that complete source tree:

  cargo run --manifest-path pyo3-ffi-check/Cargo.toml
  cargo test -p pyo3-ffi
  cargo test -p pyo3 --no-default-features --features auto-initialize,macros --no-fail-fast

Verified 2026-11-12 on Ubuntu Stonking amd64, CPython 3.15.2t, Rust 1.97.1:
all ABI structure sizes/field offsets and 22 FFI tests plus 2 FFI doctests pass.
Runtime/doc suite: 1685 passed, 76 upstream ignores. Its single diagnostic-
snapshot target fails on 20 snapshots with this newer Rust, IDENTICALLY on
unmodified v0.28.2. No snapshot, assertion or selector was changed. The
compile-error result is disclosed rather than counted as a passing full suite.
No unsafe version-check or ABI3 forward-compatibility environment flags.

The packaged src/ and build.rs after quilt application are byte-identical to
the tested upstream feature branch. ARM64 and board acceptance remain separate.
